// Token kind codes are int64 values (unique per kind). No named type alias (§3.4.2).

{-
- int64 getters for every lexer token kind code. Call e.g. token_kind_identifier() instead of a TokenKinds record field.
- Single source of truth for kind numbering shared by lexer and parser.
- Last-date-modified: 2026-07-21
- Last-modified-by: Lee S. Barney
-}

